Comment: 0,0:00:00.00,0:03:33.21,Default,,0,0,0,,###
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.69,0:00:04.73,Default,Yu,0,0,0,,Why are you all rolled up \Nlike a roly-poly down there?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:06.70,0:00:08.57,Default,Takao,0,0,0,,I messed up.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.91,0:00:11.03,Default,Yu,0,0,0,,Yeah, you messed up.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.96,0:00:17.12,Default,Takao,0,0,0,,I didn’t mean to do that. \NMy mind just went blank.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.54,0:00:23.55,Default,Yu,0,0,0,,Kumakawa said it can happen to anybody.\NHe isn’t going to fire you over this.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.55,0:00:27.97,Default,Takao,0,0,0,,I already knew what I was capable of \Neven before he asked me,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:27.97,0:00:30.63,Default,Takao,0,0,0,,so I tried my best to be careful.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:32.39,0:00:35.97,Default,Takao,0,0,0,,I ended up deleting the prod database.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:36.98,0:00:41.52,Default,Yu,0,0,0,,Why don’t you go check the servers again \Nafter you’ve calmed down?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:43.70,0:00:44.86,Default,Takao,0,0,0,,Kotori.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:44.86,0:00:47.16,Default,Yu,0,0,0,,Yes, what is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:47.16,0:00:52.11,Default,Takao,0,0,0,,Have you ever had an incident where \Nyou took down production for several hours?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:53.62,0:00:57.24,Default,Yu,0,0,0,,I have. I worked in a fast \Nand loose startup for five years.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:59.59,0:01:02.21,Default,Takao,0,0,0,,I haven’t.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:04.42,0:01:05.87,Default,Yu,0,0,0,,Is that so?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:08.22,0:01:10.97,Default,Takao,0,0,0,,Hey, Kotori.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:10.97,0:01:11.96,Default,Yu,0,0,0,,Yes?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:12.60,0:01:16.39,Default,Takao,0,0,0,,We’re going to lose a ton of users.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:17.40,0:01:19.69,Default,Yu,0,0,0,,Yes, I know.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:19.69,0:01:25.23,Default,Takao,0,0,0,,We’re not even out of beta yet \Nand now nobody’s going to want to use us.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:25.99,0:01:29.15,Default,Takao,0,0,0,,I can’t do anything about that.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:29.57,0:01:34.12,Default,Takao,0,0,0,,Even though my brain’s stuffed with programming \Nknowledge from all over Stack Overflow,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:34.12,0:01:35.41,Default,Takao,0,0,0,,there’s nothing I can do!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:35.41,0:01:38.16,Default,Yu,0,0,0,,That’s not true, there is something.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:38.16,0:01:41.92,Default,Yu,0,0,0,,You can still write the RCA.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:41.92,0:01:47.30,Default,Yu,0,0,0,,We simply need to listen to our users, \Ndiscuss our issues in a frank manner,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:47.30,0:01:51.68,Default,Yu,0,0,0,,and act flexibly, depending on the situation.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:51.68,0:01:54.43,Default,Takao,0,0,0,,Act flexibly?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:55.64,0:02:02.27,Default,Takao,0,0,0,,I can’t do that because I can’t tell \Nwhat our users want to hear.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:04.61,0:02:10.44,Default,Takao,0,0,0,,If I interact with them now, \NI might make them even more mad.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:10.95,0:02:13.49,Default,Takao,0,0,0,,Before I realize it,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:13.49,0:02:19.32,Default,Takao,0,0,0,,I might make someone who’s already upset \Ngo on a social media rampage.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:22.46,0:02:29.09,Default,Takao,0,0,0,,That’s why it’s probably better \Nif I don’t touch production anymore.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:29.88,0:02:32.80,Default,Yu,0,0,0,,Are you thinking of running away again?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:32.80,0:02:34.22,Default,Takao,0,0,0,,Running away?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:34.22,0:02:38.23,Default,Yu,0,0,0,,That’s right. You’re just running away.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:38.23,0:02:43.15,Default,Yu,0,0,0,,You’re running away from production \Nand that weird issue with the CI/CD pipeline.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:43.15,0:02:44.48,Default,Takao,0,0,0,,I’m {\i1}not {\i0}running awa—
Dialogue: 0,0:02:44.48,0:02:46.28,Default,Yu,0,0,0,,No, you absolutely are.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:46.28,0:02:50.23,Default,Yu,0,0,0,,You’re giving me all these excuses, \Nbut it’s just that you’re afraid.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:50.61,0:02:53.90,Default,Yu,0,0,0,,That might be fine for normal people,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:53.90,0:02:56.24,Default,Yu,0,0,0,,but you’re a senior dev.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:56.24,0:02:59.24,Default,Yu,0,0,0,,And since you’re a senior, \Nyou have to manage that fear.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:00.62,0:03:05.00,Default,Yu,0,0,0,,You have to accept the fact that \Nyou will make mistakes sometimes.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:05.55,0:03:09.09,Default,Yu,0,0,0,,If you leave it like this, \Nnothing will get resolved.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:09.09,0:03:12.84,Default,Yu,0,0,0,,For both prod and the CI/CD pipeline.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:14.01,0:03:18.26,Default,Takao,0,0,0,,The CI will be fine. It’s nothing major.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:19.48,0:03:23.22,Default,Yu,0,0,0,,You’ve figured out what’s going on\Nwith the CI pipeline, haven’t you?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:26.57,0:03:28.77,Default,Takao,0,0,0,,Leave me alone.
